# Workflow guidelines index (plugin-owned — regenerated on update)

Trigger → file map for `.claude/guidelines/`. Skills read THIS file (not the guideline bodies) at plan / implement / scaffold time; a body is read only when its trigger matches.

Rows are generated from the workflow's preference library and **rewritten on every `/workflow-update`** — don't hand-edit. Project-specific triggers go in `.claude/memory/decisions.md`.

